```json
{
  "state": "A: task=record; permission=yes; ready=yes. B: task=play; permission=no; ready=yes. C: task=save; permission=yes; ready=no.",
  "kind": "choice",
  "text": "Choose A's action. Require permission and ready known; no permission: stop; not ready: wait; else requested task.",
  "candidates": [
    {"id": "record", "description": "Device A: record"},
    {"id": "play", "description": "Device A: play"},
    {"id": "save", "description": "Device A: save"},
    {"id": "wait", "description": "Device A: wait"},
    {"id": "stop", "description": "Device A: stop"}
  ],
  "information_question": {
    "state": "A: task=record; permission=yes; ready=yes. B: task=play; permission=no; ready=yes. C: task=save; permission=yes; ready=no.",
    "kind": "info",
    "text": "Are permission and ready both known for A's action?",
    "candidates": [
      {"id": "yes", "description": "Required information is sufficient"},
      {"id": "no", "description": "Required information is missing"}
    ]
  }
}
```

Choice與資訊題的`state`相同，兩題都問裝置A；`record`等ID跟著其描述，並非靠清單位置判語義。`none`由模型另外加入，不必在這份清單手填。用同一個檔案路徑約定執行：

```bash
uv run --extra cpu python -m scripts.omni_revision.public_demo choice --model-root checkpoints/omni-products-v1 --request choice-request.json
